    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Thalryss is centered at 15.560491, -138.357227 under Protectorate, with 88,721,000 people across 11 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Thalryss occupies 10,649,652.80 sq mi / 27,582,474.13 sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory, about 5.407630% of Belavadös's surface. It is not merely a province but a continent-scale civic machine: Beach and grass with water, Beach and reefs with water and Ocean Surface floating settlement define its broad terrain, while its settlements intensify into Beach and grass with water, Ocean Surface floating settlement, Partial forest, Beach and reefs with water and Hybrid tree and forest floor. Population density is 3.217 people/sq km / 8.331 people/sq mi, which lets wilderness, roads, faction-held corridors, and vast uncrowded borders remain huge.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, Draconic and Reptilian Races, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Elf — Sea Elf, Tortle, Genasi — Water Genasi, Hadozee, Triton, Merfolk, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Choral Synod and The Black-Maw Myriad, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Sigrananna, Iskareth, Bastveig, Sokhivar, Thoryn-Rahek, and 3 more.",
